  "desired_description_html": "<p>A capsule-and-gel face cream from <strong>Dr.CPU+</strong>.</p><p>Mix the yellow cream capsules with the clear gel to suit your preferred texture. The supplied product information lists glutathione (500 ppm) and Lactobacillus extracellular vesicles (30,000 ppb).</p><h3>How to use</h3><p>Use the included spatula. Blend capsules and gel on your hand or face, spread evenly, and gently pat to finish.</p><ul><li>Daily mix: capsules to gel 1:1</li><li>Richer-feeling mix: 2:1</li><li>Lighter-feeling mix: 1:2</li></ul><h3>Cautions</h3><p>Stop use and consult a professional if irritation occurs. Do not use on damaged skin. Keep out of reach of children and store away from direct sunlight.</p><h3>What is included</h3><p>Yellow Glutathione formula only. Pink PDRN and green Cica products shown in range photographs are not included. Choose a single item or a 1+1 pair.</p><h3>Source and publication hold</h3><p>Daiso Mall item 1084687. Supplied images show 60 mL; the retailer title states 60 g. Confirm net contents and selling prices before publication. This product remains an unpublished draft.</p>",
  "description_target_provenance": "Previously written source-backed English draft; current task authorizes nonpublic draft registration and repair, not safety/public-sale clearance."
